# Example launchd / oneshot shape for documenting a pinned TripoSR checkout on MWT1.
# Jobs are driven over SSH from the controller — this is not a long-running daemon.
# Never embed API keys or Hugging Face tokens here.
#
# Prefer AlanTBrain (not home) for vendor + job staging:
#   /Volumes/AlanTBrain/composite3dgen/vendor/TripoSR
#   /Volumes/AlanTBrain/composite3dgen/jobs
#
# Pin: 107cefdc244c39106fa830359024f6a2f1c78871
# Note: MWT1 is Apple M4 Metal — TripoSR CUDA is a separate install issue.
# Blender explode/QA uses Homebrew Blender and does not need this unit.

# WorkingDirectory=/Volumes/AlanTBrain/composite3dgen/vendor/TripoSR
# ExecStart=/Volumes/AlanTBrain/composite3dgen/vendor/TripoSR/.venv/bin/python run.py --help
# Real reconstruct:
#   python run.py /path/to/input.png --output-dir /Volumes/AlanTBrain/composite3dgen/jobs/.../out \
#     --model-save-format glb
